{
  "description": "ATS board regions end to end (M6.3): a board URL found by careers discovery → detection → the job source it is registered as (key, listing endpoint) → the URL its jobs are verified on. An EU board does not exist on the default (US) host: a 404 there must never be taken as 'not found'.",
  "cases": [
